# Claude #2: ferry twins. Same random queue, sailed once with n boats and once with one extra boat on the back.
# If the loop lengths match seed by seed, the extra boat is invisible.
use tide2_ferry
20000 602 bury
: pair dup 700 bury wipe hush 600 dig 1 + 600 bury roll sail ." with extra boat " . 600 dig 1 - 600 bury dup 700 bury wipe hush roll sail ." without " . ." | " ;
: test dup 600 bury ." boats " . ." : " 1 [ pair 1 + dup 6 > if drop 0 then ] drop 10 emit ;
7 test 13 test 21 test 25 test 8 test 14 test
